"E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjBgdbr4tGWAxWtdvUHHX_TKTUQ3YcHCMcBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjBgdbr4tGWAxWtdvUHHX_TKTUQ3IcHCMYBKBQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjBgdbr4tGWAxWtdvUHHX_TKTUQ3YcHCMkBKAA"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwjBgdbr4tGWAxWtdvUHHX_TKTUQ3IcHCMgBKBU",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["2026/02/22   內附菜單   行動支付   960\n\n來到台北西門町商圈，隱身在絕色影城6樓的「**凪Nagi 拉麵**」絕對是拉麵控們值得一訪的熱門名單！🍜 這裡主打濃郁的豚骨湯底與高度客製化的點餐方式，讓每個人都能找到最對味的專屬拉麵。\n這次特別品嚐了香辣帶勁的「**赤王**」🌶️，特製的辣味赤王球與濃郁湯頭完美融合，辣而不燥，豐富的層次感讓嗜辣的朋友絕對會大呼過癮！而最讓人印象深刻的莫過於「**蟹王**」🦀，湯頭一入口，濃郁且鮮甜的蟹味直衝味蕾，海味的甘甜與豚骨的醇厚平衡得恰到好處，表現非常亮眼，推薦給喜歡海鮮風味的老饕！👍\n除了主食拉麵，附餐的「**冰花餃**」🥟 也相當有水準。底部煎出金黃酥脆的冰花，咬下去帶有迷人的焦香，內餡紮實且肉汁飽滿，搭配重口味的拉麵一起享用，剛好豐富了整體的口感體驗。😋\n整體來說，凪Nagi 拉麵無論是湯頭的深度還是麵條的表現都十分出色，是一碗能讓人感到暖心滿足的美味拉麵。如果來西門町逛街想吃頓熱呼呼的美食，這裡絕對是個非常棒的選擇！✨",null,[0,84]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0YzFOSVNuSlBSMFpaVWxoR1ZsTklTbkpUUjA1cFVucGtOR1ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0YzFOSVNuSlBSMFpaVWxoR1ZsTklTbkpUUjA1cFVucGtOR1ZZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0YzFOSVNuSlBSMFpaVWxoR1ZsTklTbkpUUjA1cFVucGtOR1ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0YzFOSVNuSlBSMFpaVWxoR1ZsTklTbkpUUjA1cFVucGtOR1ZZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/3388713312440332435/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnQ0YzFOSVNuSlBSMFpaVWxoR1ZsTklTbkpUUjA1cFVucGtOR1ZZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/l